---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy — Kippi"
  description="Kippi privacy policy. We collect only your email address for waitlist notifications. We do not sell your data."
  canonical="/privacy"
>
  <header class="site-header">
    <a href="/" class="wordmark" aria-label="Kippi home">Kippi</a>
  </header>

  <main class="legal-main">
    <article class="legal-article">

      <!--
        FOUNDER REVIEW FLAG:
        This is template legal copy for a pre-launch site that collects only email addresses.
        Before go-live (and certainly before App Store submission), please:
        1. Have a lawyer review this document.
        2. Replace all [PLACEHOLDER] values below.
        3. Confirm jurisdiction (currently: [JURISDICTION]).
      -->

      <header class="legal-header">
        <p class="legal-label">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="legal-title font-display">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-date">Last updated: [DATE] &mdash; <strong>DRAFT — REQUIRES FOUNDER AND LEGAL REVIEW BEFORE GO-LIVE</strong></p>
      </header>

      <div class="legal-body">

        <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          Kippi is operated by [COMPANY NAME], based in [CITY, COUNTRY] ("[JURISDICTION]").
          You can reach us at <a href="mailto:hello@kippi.help">hello@kippi.help</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          This privacy policy applies to the Kippi website at kippi.help ("the site").
          It does not yet cover the Kippi mobile application, which is in development.
          A separate policy will be published before the app launches.
        </p>

        <h2>2. What we collect</h2>
        <p>
          At this time, the only personal data we collect is your <strong>email address</strong>,
          submitted voluntarily when you join our waitlist.
        </p>
        <p>We do not collect:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Your name</li>
          <li>Health or medical information</li>
          <li>Financial information</li>
          <li>Device identifiers or tracking cookies</li>
          <li>Any information you did not provide directly</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Why we collect it</h2>
        <p>
          We collect your email address for one purpose: to notify you when the Kippi app is available.
          We will not send you marketing emails beyond this launch notification without your explicit consent.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Where we store it</h2>
        <p>
          Your email address is stored securely in Supabase, a cloud database service
          (see <a href="https://supabase.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Supabase's privacy policy</a>).
          Data is hosted in [SUPABASE REGION, e.g., US East].
          We do not store your data on any other third-party service.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Who we share it with</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell, rent, or share your email address with any third party for marketing purposes.
          We will not disclose your data unless required to do so by law.
        </p>

        <h2>6. How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          We will retain your email address until the Kippi app launches and you have been notified,
          or until you request deletion — whichever comes first.
          If the project does not launch within [TIMEFRAME, e.g., two years], we will delete all waitlist data.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
        <p>
          You have the right to:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Request a copy of the data we hold about you</li>
          <li>Request that we correct or delete your data</li>
          <li>Withdraw consent at any time</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          To exercise any of these rights, email us at
          <a href="mailto:hello@kippi.help">hello@kippi.help</a>
          with the subject line "Data request." We will respond within [TIMEFRAME, e.g., 30 days].
        </p>

        <h2>8. Cookies and tracking</h2>
        <p>
          This site does not currently use cookies or any third-party analytics tracking.
          [UPDATE THIS SECTION if analytics are added before launch.]
        </p>

        <h2>9. Children</h2>
        <p>
          This site is not directed at children under the age of 13.
          We do not knowingly collect personal data from children under 13.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          If we make material changes to this policy, we will update the "last updated" date at the top
          and, where appropriate, notify waitlist members by email.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions or concerns? Email us at
          <a href="mailto:hello@kippi.help">hello@kippi.help</a>.
        </p>

        <div class="legal-disclaimer">
          <p>
            <strong>Not medical advice.</strong> Kippi is a supportive companion application,
            not a medical device, clinical service, or emergency service.
            Nothing on this site or in the Kippi app constitutes medical or psychological advice.
            If you are experiencing a mental health emergency, please contact a qualified professional
            or call/text 988 in the US.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer-legal">
    <a href="/">Back to Kippi</a>
    <span>&middot;</span>
    <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
    <span>&copy; 2026 Kippi</span>
  </footer>
</Base>

<style>
  .site-header {
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--side-margin);
  }
  .wordmark {
    font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
    font-variation-settings: 'WONK' 0.6, 'opsz' 18;
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .legal-main {
    padding: var(--space-12) var(--side-margin) var(--space-20);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .legal-article {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    width: 100%;
  }

  .legal-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-12);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-8);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .legal-label {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 5vw, 40px);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .legal-date {
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  .legal-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .legal-body h2 {
    font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
    font-size: 18px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: calc(-1 * var(--space-3));
  }

  .legal-body p,
  .legal-body li {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .legal-body ul {
    padding-left: var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .legal-body a {
    color: var(--accent-secondary);
  }

  .legal-disclaimer {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    background: var(--bg-surface);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-default);
  }

  .legal-disclaimer p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .site-footer-legal {
    padding: var(--space-8) var(--side-margin);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .site-footer-legal a {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .site-footer-legal a:hover { color: var(--text-secondary); }

  .site-footer-legal span {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
  }

  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .site-header { padding: var(--space-8) var(--space-10); }
    .legal-main { padding-left: var(--space-10); padding-right: var(--space-10); }
  }
</style>
